{'symbol': 'PXD', 'date': '2022-05-04 16:18:00', 'title': 'PIONEER NATURAL RESOURCES REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PIONEER NATURAL RESOURCES COMPANY (NYSE:PXD) ("PIONEER" OR "THE COMPANY") TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022. PIONEER REPORTED FIRST QUARTER NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF $2.0 BILLION, OR $7.85 PER DILUTED SHARE. THESE RESULTS INCLUDE THE EFFECTS OF NONCASH MARK-TO-MARKET ADJUSTMENTS AND CERTAIN OTHER UNUSUAL ITEMS. EXCLUDING THESE ITEMS, NON-GAAP ADJUSTED INCOME FOR THE FIRST QUARTER WAS $2.0 BILLION,'}